<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_967_2915.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Frome, ehrenueste, fuersichtige und weise, sonders
<lb n="2"/>guenstig lieb herrenn, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreüwenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpuwrenn</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seüenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freüntlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gruoß</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpürlicher</unclear>
<lb n="4"/>will zuouor. Uff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dato</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sind</unclear> vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versamltem</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rath</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgere</unclear> und rathsfreünd, <persName resp="#ner">Iacob</persName>
<lb n="6"/>unnd <persName resp="#ner">Hans die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Spindler</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebruerdere</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iohann</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stud</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zimersteman</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> das Irenn anpart her-
<lb n="8"/>lichs Vorenn, uff absterbenn wlin huchsen seligenn
<lb n="9"/>frawenn, zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-87" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Roschach</placeName> neben anderen glichen miterben
<lb n="10"/>biß uff zuegestandenn, wover sie glaubwuerdige urkund
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffzelegenn</unclear>, das die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">In</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glichenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">felenn</unclear>,
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">biß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">us</unclear> ouch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegelassenn</unclear> werden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechten</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/>und wie wir bericht, das geseüetzwediger kumer
<lb n="14"/>Irenn verwaltern weitter Ingestelt wordend, dzil
<lb n="15"/>gantz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freüntlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansuechenn</unclear>, wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolten</unclear> Inen
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoguetem</unclear> gegenn üch mit unnser fuerschrift,
<lb n="17"/>befürderlichsenn, und wie In soellichem fal unnser
<lb n="18"/>statt recht zuegebe, urkund mitteilenn. So dann
<lb n="19"/>wir die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> allem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetem</unclear>, sonderlich
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzuo</unclear> sie wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befüegt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuebefuerderen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> wol ge-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Haben</unclear> wir Inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dis</unclear> Ir zimlich begeren
<lb n="22"/>nit weigern woellenn. Unnd lutet der neüw artickel
<lb n="23"/>unnsers statt und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbrechts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear>.
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Des</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kintskinder</unclear>, mit sampt den kindenn
<lb n="25"/>Iren geschwüsteren und geschwüstert erben, Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieselbigen</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kintskinder</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelassenen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eelichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hab</unclear> und
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinweg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nemen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">souil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">als</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ire</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgestorbne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Elteren</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_967_2916.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vatter</unclear> oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hetten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nemen</unclear> und erben moegen.
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Glichergestalt</unclear> ouch die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kündere</unclear>, deren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ire</unclear> elteren, vatter
<lb n="30"/>oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muter</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">todes</unclear> abgangen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werenn</unclear>, sollend <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">denselbigen</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> abgestorbnen vatters, oder der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brueder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">swester</unclear> so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> inen mit tod abgienge, sampt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desselbigen</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>abgestorbnen geschwüsterdigen, zuoerben zugon, unnd aber
<lb n="34"/>nit mer dann ainen thail, sovil als ir vatter oder
<lb n="35"/>muter, hete erben moegenn, fürus ziechenn und nemen.
<lb n="36"/>Das also die künder, in disen beden fälenn, irer vaters
<lb n="37"/>oder muter tod nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entgelten</unclear> sollenn.
<lb n="38"/>Bitten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">druff</unclear> üch unnser lieb herren und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwenn</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpürenn</unclear>, ganz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlichenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diewil</unclear> dise unnsere
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angemaßten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegenwürtigenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbgerech</unclear>-
<lb n="41"/>tigkeit bi üch vehig, wellen si hierzu mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wenigstem</unclear>
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">costenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">iemer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesin</unclear> mag, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">komen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lassenn</unclear>, alles der-
<lb n="43"/>massen, das sÿ disen unnser fürderunge, bi üch vil
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genossenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tätlich</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spürenn</unclear> und befünden
<lb n="45"/>moegenn. Das begerend wir umb üch und die
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> glichen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">merern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fälenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntlichenn</unclear>
<lb n="47"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpürlichenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerwidernn</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dat</unclear> den <origDate when="1545" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">XXVII</unclear>
<lb n="48"/>augusti anno etc. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">XLV</unclear></origDate>
<lb n="49"/><persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jacobs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bilgerin</unclear></persName> vonn
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heüwdorffenn</unclear>, vogt,
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">der rath der statt
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bischöffzell</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_967_2917.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_967_2918.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="53"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehernvestenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürsichtigenn</unclear>
<lb n="54"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Rath der
<lb n="55"/>Statt Sant Gallenn</orgName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear> lieben herren
<lb n="56"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpuren</unclear>,
</p>
